            <div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Route table, scrolls sideways on small screens">
                <table>
                    <caption>Route order: fly into Punta Arenas and bus to Puerto Natales, cross the border to El Calafate and El Chaltén, then fly to Ushuaia and home through Buenos Aires.</caption>
